contract Requests
parties we, buyer

thing Order
  amount HKD
  owner buyer
  picks list number at most 3

can ship by we
  request Notify within 1 day
  request notify within 400 days
  request notify to buyer
  request notify with state = active within 1 day
  each i in picks
    request notify within 1 day

can flood by we
  request a1 within 1 day
  request a2 within 1 day
  request a3 within 1 day
  request a4 within 1 day
  request a5 within 1 day
  request a6 within 1 day
  request a7 within 1 day
  request a8 within 1 day
  request a9 within 1 day
  request a10 within 1 day
  request a11 within 1 day
  request a12 within 1 day
  request a13 within 1 day
  request a14 within 1 day
  request a15 within 1 day
  request a16 within 1 day
  request a17 within 1 day

when notify done
  requires amount > 0
  owner = we

when notify done
  -> shipped

when ping fails
  -> shipped

test "answers"
  we create with amount = HKD 1, picks = (1, 2)
  we ship
  executor ping done
  executor notify done with amount = "x"
